        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! The <strong>Evil Elf</strong> has <strong>stolen</strong> all of <strong>Santa's Reindeer</strong> right before Christmas! He's trapped them in boxes and scattered them all over the North Pole. In this game, you have to help Santa traverse all 20 levels covering the entire North Pole to find and free his reindeer. <strong>Be careful</strong>! The Evil Elf has dropped traps for you everywhere, so watch your step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>parkour-based puzzle platformer</strong> game where your goal in every level is to find a way to free all of the Reindeer trapped in the boxes in that level. You'll need to run around, find <strong>Carrots</strong> and bring them back to the boxes to free them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull <strong>Levers</strong>, jump on <strong>Buttons</strong>, run through <strong>Candy Blocks</strong>, dodge <strong>Snowmen</strong>, and more in this magical Christmas game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you free all of Santa's Reindeer before Christmas?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/3d8eb00881ace132259e347480c66706.poster.avif?t=1765278071\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/3d8eb00881ace132259e347480c66706.webm?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/3d8eb00881ace132259e347480c66706.mp4?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/b0312a1abc1ddbfe390f43184fc2458e.poster.avif?t=1765278071\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/b0312a1abc1ddbfe390f43184fc2458e.webm?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/b0312a1abc1ddbfe390f43184fc2458e.mp4?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/614b91852f5c89068a39579b51102e99.poster.avif?t=1765278071\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/614b91852f5c89068a39579b51102e99.webm?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/614b91852f5c89068a39579b51102e99.mp4?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is a challenging game. Some of the jumps and paths you must take  require precision parkouring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>~4-8 hours</strong> of fun (or pain) in<strong> Reindeer Wrangler</strong>!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! The <strong>Evil Elf</strong> has <strong>stolen</strong> all of <strong>Santa's Reindeer</strong> right before Christmas! He's trapped them in boxes and scattered them all over the North Pole. In this game, you have to help Santa traverse all 20 levels covering the entire North Pole to find and free his reindeer. <strong>Be careful</strong>! The Evil Elf has dropped traps for you everywhere, so watch your step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>parkour-based puzzle platformer</strong> game where your goal in every level is to find a way to free all of the Reindeer trapped in the boxes in that level. You'll need to run around, find <strong>Carrots</strong> and bring them back to the boxes to free them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull <strong>Levers</strong>, jump on <strong>Buttons</strong>, run through <strong>Candy Blocks</strong>, dodge <strong>Snowmen</strong>, and more in this magical Christmas game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you free all of Santa's Reindeer before Christmas?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/3d8eb00881ace132259e347480c66706.poster.avif?t=1765278071\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/3d8eb00881ace132259e347480c66706.webm?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/3d8eb00881ace132259e347480c66706.mp4?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/b0312a1abc1ddbfe390f43184fc2458e.poster.avif?t=1765278071\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/b0312a1abc1ddbfe390f43184fc2458e.webm?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/b0312a1abc1ddbfe390f43184fc2458e.mp4?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/614b91852f5c89068a39579b51102e99.poster.avif?t=1765278071\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/614b91852f5c89068a39579b51102e99.webm?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192310/extras/614b91852f5c89068a39579b51102e99.mp4?t=1765278071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is a challenging game. Some of the jumps and paths you must take  require precision parkouring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>~4-8 hours</strong> of fun (or pain) in<strong> Reindeer Wrangler</strong>!</p>",
